* Idealised core transistors: perfectly complementary, no parasitic resistance,
* no Early effect, no capacitance, flat beta.
* Every core-device library defines subcircuits QNCORE and QPCORE (pins C B E)
* with parameter AR = emitter-area ratio, used to inject Vbe mismatch:
*   dVbe = VT*ln(AR)   (AR = 1.08 is about 2 mV)
.subckt QNCORE c b e AR=1
Q1 c b e QNI area={AR}
.ends QNCORE
.subckt QPCORE c b e AR=1
Q1 c b e QPI area={AR}
.ends QPCORE
* device models
.model QNI NPN(IS=1e-14 BF=300 BR=1)
.model QPI PNP(IS=1e-14 BF=300 BR=1)
